OL,5,G1300 Classical Live
OL,6,     FLinton Stephens introduces an
OL,7,     Fafternoon of specially made
OL,8,     Frecordings including musical
OL,9,     Fhighlights from the BBC National
OL,10,     FOrchestra of Wales, LSO St Luke's
OL,11,     Fand Ensemble Moliere.
OL,12,G1600 Composer of the Week: Fela...
OL,13,     F...Sowande and the Art Music of
OL,14,     FNigeria. 5/5. Donald Macleod
OL,15,     Ftraces Nigerian art music across
OL,16,     Fgenerations, from Akpabot to
OL,17,     FNkeiru Okoye, with Alexander
OL,18,     FDouglas.
OL,19,G1700 In Tune
OL,20,     FThe Eddie Gripper trio play live.
OL,21,     FCellist Sebastian Plano on his new
OL,22,     Falbum.
