OL,5,G2330 'Round Midnight
OL,6,     FTonight Soweto pays homage the
OL,7,     Flate totemic saxophonist Sonny
OL,8,     FRollins, who sadly passed away on
OL,9,     F25 May. Along the way, Soweto
OL,10,     Fhears from Melissa Aldana and Jean
OL,11,     FToussaint.
OL,12,G0030 Through the Night
OL,13,     FThe Gringolts Quartet and friends
OL,14,     Fperform Beethoven's String Quartet
OL,15,     Fno 11, Zemlinsky's Clarinet Trio
OL,16,     Fand Jonathan Keren's Four Spanish
OL,17,     FHomages for clarinet, guitar and
OL,18,     Fcello.
